            "notes": "Round 6 is just for buying as much [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) as possible because no significant changes can be made. \n\n**OPTIONAL BUYS**\n[R\u00fcstung von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) if you're dying quickly.\n[Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) if the enemies have a lot of HP and you're unable to burst them down because it scales with current Life.\n[Volskaya Ordnance](item_396c0970-daa8-47e3-8049-e65f03fe5cec) if you're looking to tankbust over focusing squishies. This stacks well with [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) if that is your round 5 power.",
